      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "To formally develop the Haseman-Elston (H-E) test, consider a QTL with no dominance. Suppose there are n pairs of relatives (all of the same type, such as all full- or all half-sibs), and denote the character values for the jth pair by $ z_{1j} $ and $ z_{2i} $. The model assumed is",
