    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "While we do not know $ \\pi_{jt} $, we can estimate it using $ \\pi_{jm} $, the proportion of alleles ibd at a linked marker locus. (We detail shortly how to estimate $ \\pi_{jm} $ using the observed marker information.) Conditioning on the number $ (i = 0, 1, \\text{or } 2) $ of marker alleles ibd gives",
