      "content": "where the slope $ \\beta $ and intercept $ \\alpha $ depend on the type of relatives and the recombination fraction c. For full sibs, substituting the appropriate values of $ \\Pr(\\pi_{jt} \\mid \\pi_{jm}) $ into Equation 16.37 gives (Haseman and Elston 1972),",
