    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "A significant negative slope provides evidence of a QTL linked to the marker, with the power of this test scaling with $ (1 - 2c)^{2} $ and $ \\sigma_{A}^{2} $. The expected slopes for other pairs of relatives are similarly found to be",
